    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just \"change\" though. it's not like i'm just adjusting to a new routine. it's like the part of me that actually lived is just gone. i look at the clock and i realize i have to face another 12 hours of nothingness. i don't even want to \"navigate\" through it. i just want the heaviness to stop. it feels like i'm just waiting for something to end.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
